"Tap + on the Trans. tab. Pick Income, Expense or Transfer, then the amount, category and account. The keypad has a calculator (÷ × − +). Save closes the form; Continue keeps it open for the next entry. Swipe left or right on the Trans. tab to change month (or tab, in Configuration › Swipe).": "在交易分頁點按 +。選擇「收入」、「支出」或「轉帳」,再輸入金額、類別及帳戶。鍵盤內附計算機 (÷ × − +)。「儲存」會關閉表單;「繼續」則保持開啟,方便輸入下一筆。在交易分頁向左或向右滑動即可切換月份(或切換分頁,可在 設定 › 滑動 中更改)。",
